# Example requests for any HTTP client; replace variables from prior responses.
# These examples create development records when you execute them.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8180
@phone = +919000000001
@password = COPY_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FROM_ENV
@token = COPY_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN
@business = COPY_BUSINESS_ID_FROM_ME
@ipo = COPY_IPO_ID
@customer = COPY_CUSTOMER_ID
@transaction = COPY_TRANSACTION_ID
@whatsapp_account = COPY_WHATSAPP_ACCOUNT_ID
@whatsapp_login_phone = COPY_REAL_WHATSAPP_PHONE
@attempt = COPY_PRIVATE_ATTEMPT_TOKEN
@device_token = COPY_TOKEN_DISPLAYED_ON_ORIGINAL_DEVICE
@refresh = COPY_CURRENT_REFRESH_TOKEN
@session = COPY_OWN_SESSION_ID
@installation = COPY_STABLE_INSTALLATION_UUID
@fcm_token = COPY_FIREBASE_DEVICE_TOKEN
@ipo_job_token = COPY_DEDICATED_JOB_CREDENTIAL

### Enqueue the current half-hour catalogue refresh (operator credential only)
POST {{base}}/internal/jobs/ipo-refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{ipo_job_token}}

### Catalogue terms, source observations and calculated category amounts
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/ipos?limit=50&board=Mainboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh completion, coverage and freshness
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/ipos/import-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register my Android installation after POS login and FCM token changes
PUT {{base}}/api/push-devices/{{installation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fcm_token":"{{fcm_token}}"}

### Login/recovery: retain attempt_token, recovery_message and expires_at; see docs/ANDROID_ACCOUNT_RECOVERY.md
# APP_ENV=development permits new numbers only after WhatsApp pairing approval.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/whatsapp/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone_number":"{{whatsapp_login_phone}}","device_name":"My phone"}

### Poll every two seconds until expiry and follow next_step
# link_whatsapp: enter code in WhatsApp Linked devices.
# send_recovery_message: send the exact start response's recovery_message to Message yourself from the primary phone.
# restart_login: stop polling and start again. verified/exchange: exchange below.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/whatsapp/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"attempt_token":"{{attempt}}"}

### Exchange only after verified; save both tokens atomically and register FCM again after recovery
POST {{base}}/api/auth/whatsapp/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{"attempt_token":"{{attempt}}"}

### Original signed-in device: generate a two-minute, one-use token for display
POST {{base}}/api/auth/device-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Additional device: redeem the displayed token without another WhatsApp link
POST {{base}}/api/auth/device-tokens/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{"device_token":"{{device_token}}","device_name":"Office laptop"}

### Rotate credentials; replace both stored tokens atomically
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{refresh}}"}

### List my signed-in POS devices (no credentials returned)
GET {{base}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke one of my POS sessions
DELETE {{base}}/api/sessions/{{session}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### End all my POS sessions; keep the shared WhatsApp link
POST {{base}}/api/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Disconnect WhatsApp and revoke all my POS sessions; preserves user/history
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# To request a transaction receipt, add "whatsapp_account_id":"{{whatsapp_account}}"
# to the existing transaction POST body. Use your own paired account.

### Read a requested transaction confirmation and delivery status
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions/{{transaction}}/confirmation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legacy local sign-in only when ALLOW_PASSWORD_LOGIN=true
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone_number":"{{phone}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Find your business ID
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an IPO (admin)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/ipos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"DEMO-IPO","name":"Demo IPO","opens_on":"2026-10-05","closes_on":"2026-10-08"}

### Register ownership before pairing (creates an unpaired account)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label":"Cashier phone"}

### View business-owned WhatsApp accounts
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect the stable account ID returned by registration
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start QR pairing (registering user only; retries reuse the running attempt)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/pair
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"qr"}

### Alternatively start phone-code pairing; use your real WhatsApp phone
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/pair
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"phone","phone_number":"+919000000001"}

### Poll current state and pairing code (owner only; treat codes as secrets)
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/connection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Render the current QR as a PNG with authenticated headers
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry a saved connection; startup also restores active mapped sessions
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check one number using my connected WhatsApp account (registration, not ownership)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/check-number
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone_number":"+919000001010"}

### Read a contact's available name, About and photo through my connected account
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/whatsapp-accounts/{{whatsapp_account}}/contact-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone_number":"+919000001010"}

### Upload selected mobile contact names (supplier comes from your token)
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"contacts":[{"phone_number":"+919000001010","name":"Demo contact"}]}

### Resolve a number using shared business contacts
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/contacts?phone_number=%2B919000001010
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contact dropdown: request again when the search text changes
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/contacts?q=Demo&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Browse uploaded business contacts (use next_after_phone for another page)
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/contacts?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Withdraw your own contribution
DELETE {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/contacts?phone_number=%2B919000001010
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo Customer","referral_note":"Example entry"}

### Create a transaction: total = 625.00. Repeat this request to check replay.
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"ipo_id":"{{ipo}}","customer_id":"{{customer}}","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T10:00:00+05:30","form_type_code":"CE","category":"subject_1","ce_pe_value":"20","quantity":"2.5","rate":"250"}

### Sell with positive rate: total = -625.00. Keep a separate retry key.
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-demo-sell-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"ipo_id":"{{ipo}}","customer_id":"{{customer}}","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T10:00:00+05:30","form_type_code":"CE","category":"subject_1","ce_pe_value":"20","quantity":"-2.5","rate":"250"}

### Sell with negative rate: total = 625.00; quantity still determines Sell.
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-demo-sell-negative-rate-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"ipo_id":"{{ipo}}","customer_id":"{{customer}}","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T10:00:00+05:30","form_type_code":"CE","category":"subject_1","ce_pe_value":"20","quantity":"-2.5","rate":"-250"}

### Correct quantity: total = 812.50. Repeating with version 1 returns 409.
PUT {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions/{{transaction}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ipo_id":"{{ipo}}","customer_id":"{{customer}}","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T10:00:00+05:30","form_type_code":"CE","category":"subject_1","ce_pe_value":"20","quantity":"3.25","rate":"250","expected_version":1,"change_reason":"Corrected form quantity"}

### Cancel while retaining the record and every snapshot
POST {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions/{{transaction}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expected_version":2,"change_reason":"Customer cancelled"}

### Inspect history
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions/{{transaction}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List confirmed transactions
GET {{base}}/api/businesses/{{business}}/transactions?status=confirmed&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Log out
POST {{base}}/api/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
